// What is the probability of occurrence of the Sunny state in the future?
P=? [ F x=0 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Cloudy state in the future?
P=? [ F x=1 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Rainy state in the future?
P=? [ F x=2 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Snowy state in the future?
P=? [ F x=3 ]


// What is the probability of reaching the Rainy state within seven hours?
P=? [ F<=7 x=2 ]

// What is the probability of the Sunny state initially?
P=? [ F<1 x=0 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Sunny state within three hours?
P=? [ F<=3 x=0 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Sunny state within seven hours?
P=? [ F<=7 x=0 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Cloudy state within seven hours?
P=? [ F<=7 x=1 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Rainy state within five hours?
P=? [ F<=5 x=2 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Snowy state within five hours?
P=? [ F<=5 x=3 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Snowy state within seven hours?
P=? [ F<=7 x=3 ]

// What is the probability of occurrence of the Rainy state during the 8th and 14th hour?
P=? [ F[8,14] x=2 ]
